D('pumpkinseed','Pumpkinseed','Lepomis pepo','uncommon',P,'shallow','day,dusk','summer,autumn',ANY,'worm,insect',2,'quick',(8,18),(.03,.2),11,'food','Round as a coin, among warm-weather weed.','Blue worm-lines all over the cheeks.','Blue-scribbled cheeks and a belly like an autumn gourd.')
