D('sturgeon','Lake sturgeon','Acipenser montis','very_rare',L,'bottom','dusk,night','spring',ANY,'worm,baitfish',8,'deep',(90,200),(8,60),200,'collection','Armoured shapes cruise the spring gravel in the evening.','Could be a century old.','Rows of bony shields and a shovel nose. Older than the ruin, in family and quite possibly in person.')
D('abyss_lurker','Abyss lurker','Melanocetus alpinus','very_rare',L,'deep','deep','autumn,winter',ANY,'night,lure_glow',7,'deep',(25,50),(.5,4),190,'collection','In the deepest water, a small green light that is not a star.','Should not be in a lake. Nobody knows how.','All mouth and shadow, with needle teeth and one green lamp on a stalk. Comes up slowly.')
D('starry_trout','Starry trout','Salmo sidereus','legendary',L,'surface','deep','summer,winter','clear','lure_fly,lure_glow',9,'surface',(40,70),(1,4),650,'collection','The lake holds the whole night sky. On clear nights, a few stars leave.','No two skies alike.','An indigo night sky in the shape of a trout. The stars on it are not any you can name.')
D('deepwater_warden','Deepwater Warden','Custos profundi','legendary',L,'bottom','deep','winter','fog,snow','baitfish,lure_glow',10,'deep',(130,260),(30,120),900,'collection','Fog or snow, the coldest deep of night, the lake floor: it patrols.','Do not assume you caught it. It may be allowing this.','An armoured giant, plated like a door, bearded with cold whiskers, with one ember for an eye.')
