D('blind_cavefish','Blind cavefish','Amblyopsis obscura','common',R,'mid',ALL,ANY,ANY,'worm,dough',2,'cautious',(6,14),(.01,.05),8,'food,crafting','Pale things that turn toward vibration.','Eyes skinned over long ago.','Flesh-pink, eyeless, unbothered. It feels the world along a line of tiny pits.')
D('cave_loach','Cave loach','Nemacheilus speleus','common',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'worm',1,'calm',(7,12),(.005,.02),6,'bait','Long whiskers feel across the silt.','Whiskers longer than its head.','A bone-coloured line of fish with whiskers doing the work of everything else.')
D('rust_carp','Rust carp','Cyprinus ferrugo','common',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'dough,worm',4,'strong',(30,60),(.8,5),14,'crafting','Grows where old pipes weep into the water.','Eats the rust itself.','Rivet-spotted and pitted, coloured exactly like the pipes it grazes on.')
D('drain_eel','Drain eel','Anguilla cloacae','common',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'baitfish,worm',4,'deep',(40,80),(.2,1.2),14,'food','Sleeps coiled in culverts.','Yellow eye, ring-marked body.','Black, ringed in steel-grey and curled like the pipe it lives in.')
D('tallow_catfish','Tallow catfish','Ictalurus sebum','uncommon',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'worm,baitfish',4,'nocturnal',(25,55),(.3,2),26,'crafting','A waxy shape along the old tank wall.','Its fat burns, and it was once used for lamps.','Wax-yellow and blind, soft as candle fat. Workers once fed them for the lamp oil.')
D('echo_fish','Echo fish','Sonichthys resonans','uncommon',R,'mid',ALL,ANY,ANY,'dough,insect',5,'cautious',(15,30),(.1,.6),34,'gift','Tap the wall and something taps back.','It answers sounds with a little drum of its bladder.','Grey, with ripple rings across its side, like something you dropped in the water a long time ago.')
D('coin_carp','Coin carp','Cyprinus nummus','uncommon',R,'mid',ALL,ANY,ANY,'dough',4,'strong',(25,50),(.5,3),40,'gift,trade','Someone threw wishes down here once. Something ate them.','The scales are almost round enough to spend.','Stamped all over in dark rings like old money, and as heavy as it looks.')
D('pale_olm','Pale olm','Proteus albus','rare',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'worm',4,'calm',(15,30),(.01,.04),75,'collection,gift','A pink finger with little legs, deep under everything. Not a fish, and it is in the book anyway.','Lives a hundred years. May wait ten without food.','Pink gills like a flower, tiny legs, no eyes to speak of. An amphibian that never agreed to grow up.')
D('ink_lamprey','Ink lamprey','Petromyzon atramentum','rare',R,'bottom','night,deep',ANY,ANY,'night,worm',6,'erratic',(30,60),(.1,.6),70,'crafting','Black water that is black for a reason.','It stains your hands for a week.','A dripping ink-black loop with a line of faint gill-lights and one pale eye.')
D('lantern_tetra','Lantern tetra','Hyphessobrycon lucerna','rare',R,'mid','night,deep',ANY,ANY,'night,lure_glow',4,'quick',(4,9),(.003,.01),60,'collection,crafting','Tiny lights turn together where the dark is deepest.','Keeps its light even when dried.','An indigo fish with a row of cyan lamps. A shoal looks like a small town seen from far off.')
D('spore_gourami','Spore gourami','Trichopodus sporifer','rare',R,'surface','night,deep',ANY,ANY,'dough,night',5,'cautious',(10,18),(.03,.1),80,'crafting,gift','Feeds where luminous fungus drops into the water.','Long feeler fin, tasting the water ahead.','Fungus-green, glowing in patches, with one long feeler it holds out like a candle.')
D('silt_ray','Silt ray','Potamotrygon limi','very_rare',R,'bottom',ALL,ANY,ANY,'baitfish,night',7,'deep',(30,60),(1,8),180,'collection','The silt floor has an outline. It moved.','Tail spine. Careful.','A flat disc of silt with spots for stars and a whip for a tail. Never a fish you notice first.')
D('glassscale','Glassscale','Vitrichthys pellucidus','exceptional',R,'mid','deep',ANY,'clear','lure_glow',9,'cautious',(20,35),(.2,.8),420,'collection','On quiet nights the reservoir water has a part with a fish-shaped absence.','You can see its heart beat.','A body like poured glass, with spine, ribs and a small ember of a heart all on show.')
D('hollow_serpent','The Hollow Serpent','Ophis vacuus','legendary',R,'deep','deep','autumn,winter','clear,fog','lure_glow',10,'erratic',(180,320),(10,35),1000,'collection','Something ate through the bottom of the reservoir. It has not stopped. Bring your strongest line and do not go in autumn alone.','It has ribs on the outside.','A coiled thing all black, with bone showing in rungs through its back and a thin cold light running down the middle.')
